<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">The world continue=
s to watch in horror as the scale of the loss and destruction in Nepal beco=
mes apparent. Our chief travel writer Chris Haslam was able to make it to t=
he Trishuli Valley last week, where he found scenes of unimaginable devasta=
tion, with bodies drifting hundreds of miles downriver. But he also found s=
