nderline; color: #006699;" rel=3D"noopener">save an entire school</a>. It=
=E2=80=99s a remarkable piece of reporting that I couldn=E2=80=99t recommen=
d more highly.&nbsp;</span>
</p><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p=
><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px">
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">As I was watching =
the disaster unfold, I had a sudden jolt of recognition: I knew one of thos=
e villages. My old friend Biru, who I met while trekking in the Langtang Va=
lley, has his house on the banks of the Trishuli river. Was he ok? The news=
 is not good. <a href=3D"https://link.thetimes.com/click/47259671.486848/aH=
R0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZXMuY29tL3dvcmxkL2FzaWEvYXJ0aWNsZS9teS1mcmllbmQtYmlyd=
