-decoration: underline; color: #006699;" rel=3D"noopener">I wrote about Bir=
u</a> and Nepal and the extraordinary people who live in one of our planet=
=E2=80=99s most beautiful and dangerous places.&nbsp;</span>
</p><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p=
><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px">
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">Back here in Europ=
e, things are getting increasingly bumpy, with Russia ratcheting up the rhe=
toric, much of it aimed at Britain. How worried should we be? When will we =
